@@@!atrep-hom
@=litogramma=>at-docbook

@@/ Nested to nested: the whole sectioning ladder maps onto
@@/ DocBook's uniform nesting section with structure preserved
@@/ (no extract). Level identity dissolves into depth; taxis
@@/ drops (lossy renames). Front matter dissolves, note
@@/ families unify onto the footnote, verse and tables drop
@@/ (no DocBook counterpart in the basic subset).

@@/ Front matter.
@<< =
@<< =_
@<< =:
@<< =;
@<< ="
@-- =#=

@@/ Structure: every level onto the uniform section.
@:: == #
@:: === #
@:: ## #
@:: ### #
@:: #### #
@:: #_ *
@<< .
@-- **

@@/ Inline.
@:: */ *
@<< ,
@<< $
@<< $$

@@/ Lists.
@:: .- -
@<< ::;
@<# :: *
@<< ;

@@/ Verse and drama.
@-- ~
@-- :~
@<# := *
@<# :# *
@<# : *
@:: :! *
@<# :!! *
@:: :( /
@:: :[ ! .stage
@<< :-
@:: :_ /
@:: :. /

@@/ Notes: every family unifies onto the footnote; asides too.
@:: ^^ ^
@:: ^^^ ^
@:: ^! ^
@:: | ^

@@/ Quotations.
@:: " >
@:: "/ >
@:: -/ /

@@/ Figures, tables, containers.
@<< <
@-- +
@:: _ ! 
@:: _= ! .theorema
@:: _- ! .propositio
@:: _: ! .lemma
@:: _/ ! .demonstratio

@@/ Apparatus.
@-- >
@-- >>
@-- >>>
@-- >>>>
@-- >[
@<< ><
@:: >: *
@<< %
@-- %%
@-- |-
